  </data>
	<data name="Framework.ActiveTemplateGroupBuilder.Usage" xml:space="preserve">
    <value><![CDATA[<t_context id="" Value="" Always="" Pre="" Inner="" Post="">...</t_context>
Always - write Pre and Post macros to the output independently of is the loop empty or not
Value - value to enumerate (must produce IEnumerable)
Pre - added to the output before loop execution
Post - added to the output after loop execution 
Inner - added to the output between each loop element
Loop element can be accessed through the macro #ctx;
Example:
<t_context Value="#Lib.Foreach(1,9)" Pre="<text>" Post="</text>" Inner=", ">#ctx;</t_context>
Will produce:
<text>1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9</text>]]></value>
